WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,260
What's the matter?

2
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:07,260
eldest daughter

3
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:08,460
The rescue ship is here again

4
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:10,060
Supplies are being distributed downstairs.

5
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:11,060
I'm afraid you don't know

6
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,460
I came here specially to call you.

7
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,660
Let's go down together

8
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,460
Thank you, auntie, I just woke up

9
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,460
Still need to tidy up

10
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,460
You go down first

11
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,260
I'll go there by myself in a while

12
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:20,260
Hurry up

13
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,660
Everyone is queuing up below

14
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:32,080
My relative works in the meteorological department

15
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:34,480
It’s true that it will stop raining in a few days

16
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:35,480
Are you sure?

17
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:37,070
The news should be accurate

18
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:38,470
A few more days at most

19
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:39,670
He might be right

20
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:41,070
The rain will indeed stop

21
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,470
But I’ll stop next time

22
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:43,470
That’s not wrong either.

23
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:46,430
So much

24
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:48,420
There was rice and vegetables last time

25
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:50,420
How can something like this last a week?

26
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:51,820
There are several people in the family

27
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:53,420
Doesn’t this make us hungry?

28
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:54,820
Why is there so much less this time?

29
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,020
At least I need to give you an explanation.
